    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "System Timetable\nEffective July 1, 1983\n16257\nNEW JET SERVICE TO\nSANTA BARBARA\nREDDING\nKLAMATH FALLS\nREDMOND/BEND\nPlus new Fresno and Los Angeles\nto Reno service",
      "FLY THE AIRLINE WITH ROLLS\nTWIN JETS TO 19 CITIES IN THE\nSPACE, BARGAIN AIR FARES,\nLINE CONNECTIONS\n...THAT'S THE PACIFIC\nALL FLIGHTS PROVIDED WITH ROLLS\nPortland\nRedmond/Bend\nBoise\nMedford\nKlamath Falls\nRedding\nChico\nReno/Lake Tahoe\nSacramento\nSan Francisco\nStockton\nModesto\nMonterey/Salina:\nLas Vegas\nBakersfield\nSanta Barbara\nPalm Springs\nLos Angeles\nPaCIFIC\nEXPRESS-\nNEW JET SERVICE TO\nSANTA BARBARA\nREDDING\nKLAMATH FALLS\nREDMOND/BEND\nPlus new Fresno and Los Angeles\nto Reno service\nROYCE POWERED ONE ELEVEN\nWEST. EXTRA CARRY-ON LUGGAGE\nSEAT SELECTION, AND INTER-\nTO THE WORLD...\nEXPRESS WAY!!!\nROYCE POWERED ONE ELEVEN TWIN JETS.\nMuse Air\nAir Cal\nAmerican\nNorthwest\nKLM\nTWA\nPacific Express\nEastern\nSouthwest Airlines\nHawaii Express\nWestern\nMexicana\nInternational\nCarriers\nDelta\nContinental\nPSA\nRepublic\nFrontier\nUS Air\nPan Am\nLos Angeles\nInternational Airport\nAspen\nUnited\nTexas Intl.\nSan Francisco\nInternational Airpor\nAir Canada\nAspen\nEastern\nInland Empire\nUnited\nDelta\nAmerican\nNorth Terminal\nCentral Terminal\n2\nSouth Terminal\nCP Air\nPan Am\nInternational Carriers\n2003.105 082.00/\nRepublic\nPSA\nContinental\nAlaska\nTWA\nPacific Express\nWestern\nNorthwest\nUS Air\n3"
